<title>USA: PotlaTch to relocate headquarters.</title>
<headline>PotlaTch to relocate headquarters.</headline>
<dateline>SAN FRANCISCO 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Potlatch Corp said its board approved a plan to relocate its headquarters from San Francisco to Spokane, Wash, affecting about 40 employees who work in the San Francisco and Walnut Creek corporate offices.</p>
<p>A spokeswoman said the employees have been offered positions in Spokane.  Those who choose not to move will be offered a severance package.</p>
<p>Costs were not disclosed for the move, which is expected to be completed during the third quarter of 1997.</p>
<p>It said the move will lower the company's administrative costs.</p>
</text>
